{
  "id": 60,
  "description": "# Dawn of Tradition | EST. 05/15/24\n***Your Gateway to Mastery in IMMO***\n\nWelcome to DAWN, the official training and feeder guild for the esteemed END. At DAWN, we focus on nurturing new and casual players, providing a laid-back yet structured environment where you can grow at your own pace.\n\n### Why Join DAWN?\n* **Casual Play**: Enjoy the game without the pressure. Perfect for learning and gradual improvement.\n* **Progression Path**: A clear path to join our main guild, END, for those who wish to take their game to the next level.\n* **Supportive Community**: Get help, tips, and advice from experienced players in a friendly atmosphere.\n\n### Join Requirements\n* **Discord Required:** We use it for communication and raid coordination.\n* **Activity Expectation:** Log in regularly – inactive players may be removed after 5 days without prior notice.\n\n### Kick Conditions\n* Inactivity for 5 days without notification.\n* Disrespectful or disruptive behavior.\n\n### Interested?\nJoin us on Discord and reach out to the DAWN leadership team for more information:\n* re_codes (Codes)\n* nordicwisdom (Nordic)\n* ShadowKat0929 (Shadzy)",
